   */ Declare all variables. e.g. var x = 1, y, z; This is invalid, but allow it so the checks can catch it. should not examine function's children the first child is the catch var and the third child is the code block only one child to scan Variables can only occur in statement-level nodes, so we only need to traverse children in a couple special cases.

